@startuml
!include style.iuml
top to bottom direction
hide empty members
class AdsModule {
 - service : AdsService
 + Save : AdsSaveBridge
 + Configure(settings)
 + Shutdown()
}
class AdsService
interface IAdsService <<interface>>
class AdsSaveBridge {
 - service : IAdsService
 - save : AdSave
 + SetNoAds(bool)
 + Tick()
}
class AdSave
class SaveController
AdsModule *-down- AdsService : tạo / Dispose
AdsModule -down-> AdsSaveBridge : Save
AdsService ..|> IAdsService
AdsSaveBridge --> IAdsService : service
AdsSaveBridge --> AdSave : save
AdsSaveBridge ..> SaveController : GetSaveObject / mark dirty
note bottom of AdsModule
Application lifetime thuộc Initializer.
Scene popup không shutdown AdsModule.
Configure lấy provider từ settings.Provider.CreateProvider().
end note
@enduml
